A%26B+Luxury+Digital+Marketing+Agency/@-28.0268725,153.4331782,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x6b9105220bd18911:0x6cde969dd828ba74!8m2!3d-28.0268725!4d153.4331782!16s%2Fg%2F11x5__9hz5?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDYzMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank"><h3>Brisbane</h3></a></div></div><div class="row"><div class="padsmdt col-lg-2 col-md-2 col-sm-2 col-3"><img src="https://anbluxury.com/img/map-pin.png" class="boxsm" height="22" width="15"></div><a class="" href="https://anbluxury.com/luxury-digital-agency-bangalore.html"><div class="padsmdt footer-arrow col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-9"><h3 class="">Bangalore</h3></div></a></div><div class="row"><div class="padsmdt col-lg-2 col-md-2 col-sm-2 col-3"><img src="https://anbluxury.com/img/pirate.png" height="38" width="38" class="img-fluid"></div><div class="padsmdt col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-9"><p>To board the ship, interact with Coco (Chatbot)</p></div></div></div></div><div class="padsmdt col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-12"><iframe loading="lazy" src="cid:frame-2626EE6539661933ACF606B7E95CC3BB@mhtml.blink" width="100%" height="600" frameborder="0" style="background-color:#0d0d0d"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div><div class="abf" data-abf-footer="true"><section class="abf-story" aria-label="A&amp;B Luxury perspective"><div class="abf-story-inner"><div class="abf-roll" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" style="min-height:48px"><span class="abf-line">Most media houses buy attention. Few know whose attention is worth buying.</span><span class="abf-line">A low CPL is expensive when the lead cannot afford you.</span><span class="abf-line">Luxury is not an interest you select on Meta.</span><span class="abf-line">More media only makes weak positioning fail faster.</span><span class="abf-line is-live">Retargeting the wrong audience only wastes the budget twice.</span><span class="abf-line">Anyone can spend the budget. Strategy decides where not to spend it.</span><span class="abf-line">A luxury publisher does not automatically make it to a luxury media plan.</span><span class="abf-line">Performance without positioning is just promotion with better tracking.</span><span class="abf-line">Most firms rent audience intelligence. We built OSIDE.</span><span class="abf-line">Media was never the whole answer. That is why A&amp;B begins with strategy.</span><span class="abf-line">We built A&amp;B for the gap between media delivered and business achieved.</span></div><div class="abf-intro"><p><strong>A&amp;B LUXURY</strong> is a luxury marketing consultancy and digital media company working with premium, luxury and heritage brands. We help brands strengthen visibility, reach affluent audiences and drive measurable business growth.</p><p>Our services are designed specifically for luxury businesses and include <a href="https://anbluxury.com/media-buying-agency-luxury.html">luxury brand strategy</a>, affluent audience planning, <a href="https://anbluxury.com/luxury-e-commerce-agency.html">premium media planning and buying</a>, performance marketing, <a href="https://anbluxury.com/digital-lead-generation-agency-luxury.html">SEO</a> and GEO optimisation, <a href="https://anbluxury.com/luxury-e-commerce-agency.html">ecommerce growth</a>, <a href="https://anbluxury.com/retail-digital-marketing-agency-luxury.html">retail footfall campaigns</a>, <a href="https://anbluxury.com/digital-lead-generation-agency-luxury.html">high-value customer acquisition and qualified lead generation</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="abf-band" aria-label="Footer links and credentials"><div class="abf-band-inner"><a class="abf-privacy" href="https://anbluxury.com/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a><span class="abf-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="abf-group"><span class="abf-label">Associations &amp; Certifications</span><div class="abf-icons abf-association-icons" aria-label="A&amp;B Luxury associations and certifications"><span class="abf-icon abf-static-icon" role="img" aria-label="Global association"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M12 4c2.2 2.2 3.2 4.9 3.2 8S14.2 17.8 12 20"></path><path d="M12 4c-2.2 2.2-3.2 4.9-3.2 8S9.8 17.8 12 20"></path></svg></span><span class="abf-icon abf-static-icon" role="img" aria-label="Media certification"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M12 4v2"></path><path d="M20 12h-2"></path><path d="M12 20v-2"></path><path d="M4 12h2"></path></svg></span><span class="abf-icon abf-static-icon" role="img" aria-label="Verified certification"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3.5 19 6v5.2c0 4.4-2.7 7.7-7 9.3-4.3-1.6-7-4.9-7-9.3V6l7-2.5Z"></path><path d="m8.8 12 2.1 2.1 4.4-4.4"></path></svg></span><span class="abf-icon abf-static-icon" role="img" aria-label="Partner network"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.7"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="1.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="12" r="1.7"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.7"></circle><path d="m12 6.7-4.8 4.1"></path><path d="m12 6.7 4.8 4.1"></path><path d="M7.7 12h8.6"></path><path d="m7.2 13.2 3.8 4.5"></path><path d="m16.8 13.2-3.8 4.5"></path></svg></span></div></div><span class="abf-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="abf-group"><span class="abf-label">Our Socials</span><div class="abf-icons abf-social-icons" aria-label="A&amp;B Luxury social media"><a class="abf-icon" href="https://www.youtube.com/@anb_luxury/videos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="A&amp;B Luxury on YouTube"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 8.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-2-2C17.3 5.7 12 5.7 12 5.7s-5.3 0-7 .5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-2 2A29 29 0 0 0 2.5 12 29 29 0 0 0 3 15.8a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 2 2c1.7.5 7 .5 7 .5s5.3 0 7-.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 2-2 29 29 0 0 0 .5-3.8A29 29 0 0 0 21 8.2Z"></path><path class="abf-icon-fill" d="m10 9 5 3-5